{"id":"c9bc37149b696d79","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-model-filtration-of-structure.md","title":"ZFC Model Filtration Of Structure","display":"df-zfc-model-filtration-of-structure — ZFC Model Filtration Of Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-filtration-of-structure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-filtration-of-structure"],"display":"df-zfc-model-filtration-of-structure — ZFC Model Filtration Of Structure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]","[[58-df-substructure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-filtration-of-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-filtration-of-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-filtration-of-structure — ZFC Model Filtration Of Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md\">../batch08/58-df-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"58-df-substructure.md\">58-df-substructure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A},\\kappa,\\vec A\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal{A},\\kappa,\\vec A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\\)</span> (indexed chain, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Limit}\">\\(\\mathrm{Limit}\\)</span> (ordinal predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A_i,\\mathcal A,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A_i,\\mathcal A,L)\\)</span> (substructure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"58-df-substructure.md\">58-df-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelFiltrationOfStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelFiltrationOfStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}filtration\\text{-}of\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelFiltrationOfStructure}_S(\\mathcal{A},\\kappa,\\vec A) \\leftrightarrow \\exists L\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\land \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\\land \\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\kappa}\\vec A(i)\\land \\forall i\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\mathcal A_i\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A_i,\\mathcal A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A_i)=\\vec A(i)\\bigr)\\land \\forall i,j\\in\\kappa\\;(i\\in j\\to \\vec A(i)\\subseteq\\vec A(j))\\land \\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;(\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\\to \\vec A(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\lambda}\\vec A(i))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}filtration\\text{-}of\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelFiltrationOfStructure}_S(\\mathcal{A},\\kappa,\\vec A) \\leftrightarrow \\exists L\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\land \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\\land \\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A)=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\kappa}\\vec A(i)\\land \\forall i\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists\\mathcal A_i\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(\\mathcal A_i,\\mathcal A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal A_i)=\\vec A(i)\\bigr)\\land \\forall i,j\\in\\kappa\\;(i\\in j\\to \\vec A(i)\\subseteq\\vec A(j))\\land \\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;(\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\\to \\vec A(\\lambda)=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\lambda}\\vec A(i))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every stage is now required to be the carrier of an actual substructure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>; a continuous chain of arbitrary subsets is not a filtration of a structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","